"40x50cm, 8x10\", 16x20\"</p><p><b>5:7</b>: 15x21cm, 30x42cm, 5x7\"</"
"p><p><b>7:10</b>: 21x30cm, 42x60cm, 3.5x5\"</p><p><b>8:5</b>: common wide-"
"screen monitor (as 1680x1050)</p><p><b>2:1</b>, <b>3:1</b>, <b>4:1</b>: "
"common panoramic sizes</p><p><b>16:9</b>: common tv-screen (as HDTV or Full-"
"HD)</p><p>The <b>Golden Ratio</b> is 1:1.618. A composition following this "
"rule is considered visually harmonious but can be unadapted to print on "
"standard photographic paper.</p><p>The <b>Current Aspect Ratio</b> takes "
"aspect ratio from the currently opened image.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Söök hier Dien Bildproportschoon för't Tosnieden ut. Dit Warktüüch bruukt "
"relative Proportschonen, wat bedüüdt, dat bloots de Proportschonen vun de "
"Bildkanten angeven warrt, nich ehr Längden.</p><p>De List nerrn gifft "
"normaal Formaten vun Fotopapeer un ehr Bildkantenproportschoon an:</"
"p><p><b>2:3</b>: 10x15cm, 20x30cm, 30x45cm, 4x6\", 8x12\", 12x18\", 16x24\", "
"20x30\"</p><p><b>3:4</b>: 6x8cm, 15x20cm, 18x24cm, 30x40cm, 3,75x5\", "
"4,5x6\", 6x8\", 7,5x10\", 9x12\"</p><p><b>4:5</b>: 20x25cm, 40x50cm, 8x10\", "
"16x20\"</p><p><b>5:7</b>: 15x21cm, 30x42cm, 5x7\"</p><p><b>7:10</b>: "
"21x30cm, 42x60cm, 3,5x5\"</p><p>De <b>Gollen Snitt</b> liggt bi 1:1,618. "
"Disse Proportschoon warrt vun de mehrsten Lüüd as harmoonsch estemeert, man "
"lett sik nich goot op Standard-Fotopapeer drucken.</p>"

