#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jp2ksettings.cpp:77
msgid ""
"<p>Toggle lossless compression for JPEG 2000 images.</p><p>If this option is "
"enabled, a lossless method will be used to compress JPEG 2000 pictures.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Verlustfree Komprimeren för JPEG2000-Biller an- oder utmaken</p><p>Is dit "
"anmaakt, warrt en verlustfree Metood för't Komprimeren vun JPEG2000-Biller "
"bruukt.</p>"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jp2ksettings.cpp:84
msgid "JPEG 2000 quality:"
msgstr "JPEG2000-Gööd:"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jp2ksettings.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<p>The quality value for JPEG 2000 images:</p><p><b>1</b>: low quality (high "
"compression and small file size)<br/><b>50</b>: medium quality<br/><b>75</"
"b>: good quality (default)<br/><b>100</b>: high quality (no compression and "
"large file size)</p><p><b>Note: JPEG 2000 is not a lossless image "
"compression format when you use this setting.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>De Gööd-Weert för JPEG2000-Biller:</p><p><b>1</b>: Siete Gööd (hoge "
"Komprimeren un lütte Datei)<br/><b>50</b>: Middelgööd<br/><b>75</b>: Gode "
"Gööd (Vörinstellen)<br/><b>100</b>: Hoge Gööd (keen Komprimeren un grote "
"Datei)</p><p><b>Beacht: JPEG2000 is keen verlustfree Bildkomprimeerformaat, "
"wenn Du disse Optschoon bruukst.</b></p>"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jpegsettings.cpp:84
msgid "JPEG quality:"
msgstr "JPEG-Gööd:"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jpegsettings.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<p>The JPEG quality:</p><p><b>1</b>: low quality (high compression and small "
"file size)<br/><b>50</b>: medium quality<br/><b>75</b>: good quality "
"(default)<br/><b>100</b>: high quality (no compression and large file size)</"
"p><p><b>Note: JPEG always uses lossy compression.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>De Gööd-Weert för JPEG-Biller:</p><p><b>1</b>: Siete Gööd (hoge "
"Komprimeren un lütte Datei)<br/><b>50</b>: Middelgööd<br/><b>75</b>: Gode "
"Gööd (Vörinstellen)<br/><b>100</b>: Hoge Gööd (keen Komprimeren un grote "
"Datei)</p><p><b>Beacht: JPEG bruukt jümmers en Bildkomprimeermetood mit "
"Verlusten.</b></p>"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jpegsettings.cpp:95
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<font color='red'><i>Warning: <a href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"JPEG'>JPEG</a> is a lossy image compression format.</i></font>"
msgstr ""
"<font size='-1' color='red'><i>Wohrschoen: <a href='http://de.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/JPEG'>JPEG</a> bruukt en Bildkomprimeermetood mit Verlusten.</i></font>"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jpegsettings.cpp:105
msgid "Chroma subsampling:"
msgstr "Klören sieter aftasten:"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jpegsettings.cpp:109
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Middel"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jpegsettings.cpp:110
msgid "High"
msgstr "Hooch"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/jpegsettings.cpp:111
msgid ""
"<p>JPEG Chroma subsampling level \n"
"(color is saved with less resolution than luminance):</p><p><b>None</"
"b>=best: uses 4:4:4 ratio. Does not employ chroma subsampling at all. This "
"preserves edges and contrasting colors, whilst adding no additional "
"compression</p><p><b>Medium</b>: uses 4:2:2 ratio. Medium compression: "
"reduces the color resolution by one-third with little to no visual "
"difference</p><p><b>High</b>: use 4:1:1 ratio. High compression: suits "
"images with soft edges but tends to alter colors</p><p><b>Note: JPEG always "
"uses lossy compression.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>JPEG-Klööraftaststoop\n"
"(De Klöör warrt mit en sieter Oplösen as de Helligkeit aftast):</p> "
"<p><b>Keen</b>: Bruukt en Proportschoon vun 4:4:4. De Klören warrt liek so "
"aftast as de Helligkeit. Wohrt Kanten un Klöörkontrasten, man deit nich so "
"goot komprimeren.</p><p><b>Middel</b>: Bruukt en Proportschoon vun 4:2:2. "
"Middelhoge Komprimeren, Biller bruukt een Drüddel weniger Bandbreed, bloots "
"lütt oder keen sichtbor Verscheel.</p><p><b>Hooch</b>: Bruukt en "
"Proportschoon vun 4:1:1. Höger Komprimeren, passt för Biller mit weke "
"Ränners, man maakt de Klören mennigmaal en beten kunstig.</p><p><b>Beacht "
"bitte: JPEG bruukt en BildkomprimeerMetood mit Verlusten.</b></p>"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/pgfsettings.cpp:75
msgid "Lossless PGF files"
msgstr "PGF-Dateien ahn Verlust"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/pgfsettings.cpp:77
msgid ""
"<p>Toggle lossless compression for PGF images.</p><p>If this option is "
"enabled, a lossless method will be used to compress PGF pictures.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Verlustfree Komprimeren för PGF-Biller an- oder utmaken</p><p>Is dit "
"anmaakt, warrt en verlustfree Metood för't Komprimeren vun PGF-Biller bruukt."
"</p>"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/pgfsettings.cpp:84
msgid "PGF quality:"
msgstr "PGF-Gööd:"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/pgfsettings.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<p>The quality value for PGF images:</p><p><b>1</b>: high quality (no "
"compression and large file size)<br/><b>3</b>: good quality (default)<br/"
"><b>6</b>: medium quality<br/><b>9</b>: low quality (high compression and "
"small file size)</p><p><b>Note: PGF is not a lossless image compression "
"format when you use this setting.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>De Gööd-Weert för PGF-Biller:</p><p><b>1</b>: Hoge Gööd (keen Komprimeren "
"un grote Datei)<br/><b>3</b>: Gode Gööd (Vörinstellen)<br/><b>6</b>: "
"Middelgööd<br/><b>9</b>: Siete Gööd (hoge Komprimeren un lütte Datei)</"
"p><p><b>Beacht, wenn Du disse Optschoon bruukst: PGF is keen verlustfree "
"Bildkomprimeerformaat.</b></p>"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/pngsettings.cpp:74
msgid "PNG compression:"
msgstr "PNG-Komprimeren:"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/pngsettings.cpp:76
msgid ""
"<p>The compression value for PNG images:</p><p><b>1</b>: low compression "
"(large file size but short compression duration - default)<br/><b>5</b>: "
"medium compression<br/><b>9</b>: high compression (small file size but long "
"compression duration)</p><p><b>Note: PNG is always a lossless image "
"compression format.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>De Komprimeer-Weert för PNG-Biller:</p><p><b>1</b>: Siete Komprimeren "
"(grote Datei, man gaue Komprimeren - Vörinstellen)<br/><b>5</b>: Middelstark "
"Komprimeren<br/><b>9</b>: Hoge Komprimeren (lütte Datei, man lange "
"Komprimeer-Duer)</p><p><b>Anmarken: PNG komprimeert jümmers ahn Verlusten.</"
"b></p>"

#. +> trunk5
#: libs/dimg/loaders/tiffsettings.cpp:65
